))=␀indexsqlite_autoindex_users_2users)=␀indexsqlite_autoindex_users_1users␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀É␀≤É\!‡ßß␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀-A␀indexsqlite_autoindex_reports_1reportsîK®mtablereportsreportsCREATE TABLE reports (
	id VARCHAR(40) NOT NULL, 
	reporter_id VARCHAR(80) NOT NULL, 
	beach_id VARCHAR(80) NOT NULL, 
	beach_name VARCHAR(160), 
	quantities TEXT, 
	location_source VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL, 
	photo_key VARCHAR(500) NOT NULL, 
	photo_mime VARCHAR(64) NOT NULL, 
	photo_stripped BOOLEAN NOT NULL, 
	qty_plastic VARCHAR(20), 
	qty_fishing_gear VARCHAR(20), 
	qty_glass VARCHAR(20), 
	qty_metal VARCHAR(20), 
	qty_paper VARCHAR(20), 
	qty_other VARCHAR(20), 
	category VARCHAR(40) NOT NULL, 
	quantity VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL, 
	lat FLOAT, 
	lng FLOAT, 
	item_counts TEXT, 
	proximity_ref VARCHAR(64), 
	event_id VARCHAR(100), 
	status VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL, 
	status_note TEXT, 
	created_at DATETIME NOT NULL, 
	updated_at DATETIME NOT NULL, 
	deleted_at DATETIME, 
	PRIMARY KEY (id), 
	CONSTRAINT reports_location_source_check CHECK (location_source IN ('gps','manual')), 
	CONSTRAINT reports_photo_mime_check CHECK (photo_mime IN ('image/jpeg','image/png','image/heic')), 
	CONSTRAINT reports_qty_plastic_check CHECK (qty_plastic IN ('Small','Medium','Large','Very Large')), 
	CONSTRAINT reports_qty_fishing_gear_check CHECK (qty_fishing_gear IN ('Small','Medium','Large','Very Large')), 
	CONSTRAINT reports_qty_glass_check CHECK (qty_glass IN ('Small','Medium','Large','Very Large')), 
	CONSTRAINT reports_qty_metal_check CHECK (qty_metal IN ('Small','Medium','Large','Very Large')), 
	CONSTRAINT reports_qty_paper_check CHECK (qty_paper IN ('Small','Medium','Large','Very Large')), 
	CONSTRAINT reports_qty_other_check CHECK (qty_other IN ('Small','Medium','Large','Very Large')), 
	CONSTRAINT reports_category_check CHECK (category IN ('Plastic','Fishing gear','Glass','Metal','Paper','Other')), 
	CONSTRAINT reports_quantity_check CHECK (quantity IN ('Small','Medium','Large','Very Large')), 
	CONSTRAINT reports_status_check CHECK (status IN ('Counted','Duplicate','Incomplete')), 
	CONSTRAINT reports_at_least_one_category_check CHECK (((CASE WHEN qty_plastic IS NOT NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) + (CASE WHEN qty_fishing_gear IS NOT NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) + (CASE WHEN qty_glass IS NOT NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) + (CASE WHEN qty_metal IS NOT NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) + (CASE WHEN qty_paper IS NOT NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) + (CASE WHEN qty_other IS NOT NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)) >= 1), 
	CONSTRAINT reports_manual_has_no_coords_check CHECK (location_source = 'gps' OR (lat IS NULL AND lng IS NULL)), 
	CONSTRAINT reports_note_only_when_excluded_check CHECK (status <> 'Counted' OR status_note IS NULL), 
